                "createdBy": "alex",
                "changeSummary": "Create illustrative blog content for the WCSpedia prototype.",
                "title": "Making knowledge easier to find",
                "summary": "How clear titles, short summaries and useful business-area labels help colleagues find the right starting point.",
                "sections": [
                  {
                    "id": "search",
                    "title": "Think like the person searching",
                    "paragraphs": [
                      "A reader often arrives with a task in mind, rather than the name of a document. In this sample, the title “Prepare a team handover” is easier to recognise than “Notes — final update”."
                    ],
                    "bullets": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "titles",
                    "title": "Give each page a clear purpose",
                    "paragraphs": [
                      "Use a direct title and a short summary that explain what the page helps a colleague do. Choose the most relevant content type and business area."
                    ],
                    "bullets": [
                      "Write the title using the language colleagues use in daily work.",
                      "Describe the audience and outcome in the opening lines.",
                      "Keep the approved guidance in one maintained source."
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "maintenance",
                    "title": "Keep discovery useful over time",
                    "paragraphs": [
                      "When a document changes, its summary should still describe the published version. A new draft should not appear to readers as approved guidance before review and approval are complete."
                    ],
                    "bullets": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "discussion",
                    "title": "A question for your next team meeting",
                    "paragraphs": [
                      "Which question do colleagues ask repeatedly, and what title would they naturally search for? Use a fictional example to test whether your proposed title and summary answer that question."
                    ],
                    "bullets": []
                  }
                ],
